WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.724
A multilingual sitemap lists
every language version of a page

2
00:00:04.724 --> 00:00:06.813
as its own url entry.

3
00:00:07.213 --> 00:00:09.001
Each entry lists every version,

4
00:00:09.001 --> 00:00:12.750
including itself, as
xhtml:link alternates.

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.213
Split files at 50,000 URLs or 50MB.

6
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:22.445
General Translation's gt-next
gives each locale its own URL

7
00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:23.884
for the sitemap to list.

8
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.621
Keep pathConfig and
localeRoutes in one module,

9
00:00:28.621 --> 00:00:33.137
and import it into the
middleware and app/sitemap.ts.

10
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:37.736
The sitemap then lists exactly
the URLs your app serves.

11
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.504
Each build now lists every
language version of each page.
